<title>UK: Wuerttemburg Hypo sets 100 mln mark REX-linked bon.</title>
<headline>Wuerttemburg Hypo sets 100 mln mark REX-linked bon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBURGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **5.5 PCT   MATURITY    30.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    STUT	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR YEAR ONE, THEN 81 PCT OF 10-YEAR REX YIELD</p>
<p>		SUBINDEX</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
